WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
Think that's my brother

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,400
He is the leader here

3
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:03,480
After the zombie outbreak

4
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,560
Let's hide in this cave we found while digging into the mountain.

5
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:06,620
Are there many of you?

6
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:07,700
It's better to be dead

7
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,060
Thirty-one now

8
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:10,100
No thirty-two

9
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,420
There's another one coming soon

10
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:13,660
My Uncle Hai’s wife is going to have a baby

11
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:18,310
Originally, we had almost cleared away the zombies outside.

12
00:00:18,310 --> 00:00:21,270
I was planning to go to the family building to get medical supplies to help my Uncle Hai.

13
00:00:21,270 --> 00:00:23,300
Got bought by your helicopter business

14
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:46,140
It's difficult to give birth. Call us.
